# Cloudflare Pages — SPA fallback ONLY for HTML routes (static /assets files served from dist)
/website/*   /website/:splat   200
/research/*  /research/:splat  200
/images/*    /images/:splat    200

# Thank-you pages — real static pages (200, not the SPA shell) so applicants
# never bounce to the homepage or a dead end.
# NOTE: served by Cloudflare Pretty URLs — `thank-you.html` auto-resolves at the
# extensionless `/thank-you` (same as sherpacarta.org). Do NOT add
# `/thank-you /thank-you.html 200` rewrites: they collide with Pretty-URL
# .html-stripping into a self-308 loop (verified 2026-09-13).

/*           /index.html       200